Just one enhancement: With your diff the game didn't specify the object to
be dipped when dipping to a potion.
To change that, after the IS_FOUNTAIN and is_pool condition branches,
replace the 

        if(!(potion = getobj(beverages, "dip into")))
                return(0);

with

        Sprintf(qbuf, "dip %s into", the(xname(obj)));
        if(!(potion = getobj(beverages, qbuf)))
                return(0);

I didn't make a diff of this yet because my line numbers differ because of
the helplessness patch, but finding it where the earlier diff goes should
be easy.

